{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuJ9s2at4uHiCkcr2od9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I created the dashboard and the alert rule in Kibana. The rule has already run once with no errors. I didn't check whether the dashboard's charts show data.\n\n**1. What the data holds.** Each document in `kibana_sample_data_logs` is one web request. The time field is `timestamp`, and each record includes:\n- the response code (`response`), stored as text, not a number\n- the URL and request path (`url`, `request`)\n- the response size (`bytes`)\n- the client IP (`clientip`)\n- source and destination countries (`geo.src`, `geo.dest`)\n- the client's operating system (`machine.os`), browser (`agent`), file extension (`extension`), host and referrer\n\n**2. Dashboard: \"EFF-7fedbb49 Web logs overview\"** ([open it](http://localhost:15601/app/dashboards#/view/eff-7fedbb49-web-logs-overview-191af51ad1b2)) has seven panels:\n- Three single numbers: total requests, unique visitors (counted as unique client IPs), and total bytes served\n- A bar chart of requests over time, split by response code\n- A pie chart of response codes\n- A table of the top 10 URLs, with request count and bytes for each\n- A bar chart of requests by source country (top 10)\n\n**3. Alert rule: \"EFF-7fedbb49 5xx spike\"** (id `3b180c44-be21-4399-b99e-b4406329855d`)\n- **Schedule:** checks every minute.\n- **Condition:** fires when more than 10 requests with a 5xx code arrive within 5 minutes. Because the response code is stored as text, it counts every code that starts with \"5\".\n- **Status:** I turned it on, though the tool would have created it switched off by default. Its first run finished without errors.\n- **Notifications:** it has no notification connector, so when it fires it only shows up in Kibana's alerts view. Nobody gets a message."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":273,"cache_read_input_tokens":21440,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":273},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0536cbf5-c97a-5467-80bd-e50c5d30a2ce","uuid":"282b3867-a91e-4949-86f4-c892434cddf2","timestamp":"2026-10-10T21:51:21.823Z","request_id":"req_011CfuJ9rogUaa6886F3gSe9"}
